.py` - Convert to config-only\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Total lines of code reduced by at least 50%\\n- [ ] All existing functionality preserved (test coverage validates)\\n- [ ] New templates can be created with <100 lines of configuration\\n- [ ] Template-specific prompts are clearly separated from common infrastructure\\n- [ ] Report generation uses ReportHints configuration consistently\\n\\n## Potential Challenges\\n\\n- **Prompt flexibility**: Some templates have unique prompt structures that may resist standardization. Mitigation: Allow template-specific prompt overrides while providing sensible defaults.\\n- **Testing coverage**: Ensuring refactored code maintains behavior parity. Mitigation: Create comprehensive test suite before refactoring.\\n- **Migration complexity**: 10 templates need updating simultaneously. Mitigation: Implement incrementally, keeping both approaches working during transition.\"\n}'"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":533,"cache_read_input_tokens":127611,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":533},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82343d47-30e9-47a3-93fa-efd2489cfa93","uuid":"3cba3188-279d-4f08-9e92-8938fde6707c"}
